      "description": "Zuckerman–Kuhlman Personality Questionnaire (Shortened, ZKPQ-50-CC). Zuckerman-Kuhlman Personality Questionnaire (50-item cross-cultural). Five 10-item factor sums (each item 0/1; reverse handled), range 0-10: Activity (1-10), Aggression-Hostility (11-20), Impulsive Sensation Seeking (21-30), Neuroticism-Anxiety (31-40), Sociability (41-50).",
